#: ui/pages.slint:1966
msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid "Unlock with Windows Hello"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages.slint:1973
msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid ""
"Open this vault with your face, fingerprint or Windows PIN instead of typing "
"the master password. The key is made inside this computer's security chip "
"and only works here, after Windows Hello checks it's you. Every 14 days the "
"master password is asked once, so you don't forget it, and changing the "
"master password turns this off. Anyone who knows your Windows PIN could open "
"the vault on this computer."
msgstr ""

